# Made-up buttons and entries in place of the phone's (see monkey.jungle),
# opening on the buttons, without the glance so that the simulator opens
# straight on them. For a capture of another page, add a jungle that
# excludes live and the other shot* annotations (TallySample.page); for
# the glance, one that leaves glanceview in.
base.excludeAnnotations = live;shotrings;shotstrip;shotbefore;shotglance;glanceview
